<title>USA: Polar Air Cargo pilots vote to join ALPA union.</title>
<headline>Polar Air Cargo pilots vote to join ALPA union.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilots at all-cargo carrier Polar Air Cargo have voted to join the Air Line Pilots Association (ALPA), the union said.</p>
<p>ALPA said 75 percent of the 153 pilots eligible to vote opted to join the union.</p>
<p>Results were announced Thursday by the National Mediation Board in Washington. ALPA represents pilots at most major airlines as well as Federal Express Corp.</p>
<p>-Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
